<h2 id="about-title" class="mt-0 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Hello, I’m Johan.<br>The person behind<br><em>Three Paw Forge.</em></h2>
<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">I started learning about bladesmithing and blacksmith joinery at <a href="https://www.artistblacksmithschool.com/">Hot Milk Forge</a>. I still attend classes here to learn new things, meet new people and work on larger pieces.</p>
<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">I’ll be sharing finished pieces alongside the process: the experiments, the details, and what I learn as I go.</p>
